CYLScenarioExampleTruncated.gif
  test fixture for the GIF decode fallback (docs/HarmonyOS.md, TODO "GIF decode fallback", E12): the first 1214
  bytes of CYLPlaceholderNoFavorites.gif (the whole first frame, then the start of the second image, no trailer), so
  the frame list does not decode but the first frame does; made by cutting the file, no other change
