  sha256:  01c5485f5734696d83dcfc7e06b819a213b6c5cd077c76935b6a10f8f782225a

CYLScenarioExampleBroken.gif
  test fixture for the GIF decode fallback (E12): a GIF89a header followed by 32 bytes of 0xFF and the SHA-256 of
  "CYLScenarioExampleBroken" twice: no image decoder can read it, so the placeholder keeps its fallback image
  source:  generated for this project (no third-party content)
  license: MIT (this project's LICENSE)
  sha256:  72199f94cc525ed02df17514ff3b83aa6d9e13f47a05a504f3210e946506326b

